# Intervals containing poles, NaNs or infinities in sampled ranges.
approx tan(x) in -2..2 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx 1/(x-0.5) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 list 1
approx 1/(x*x+1e-12) in -1..1 degree 4 as f32 list 1
approx exp(x) in -50..50 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
